stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> UPLOADED : upload stored, job queued
    UPLOADED --> PROCESSING : worker claims the job
    PROCESSING --> READY : results saved
    PROCESSING --> FAILED : document problem, or retries used up
    PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : temporary failure, retried later
    READY --> PROCESSING : user asks to process again
    FAILED --> PROCESSING : user tries again
    READY --> [*] : deleted
    FAILED --> [*] : deleted
